# Approved screenshot baselines for the native smoke harness.
#
# The screenshots mode of scripts/smoke/run-smoke.sh compares VHS-captured
# PNGs byte-for-byte against <frame>.approved.png files committed here.
#
# Baselines are NOT generated locally. The first screenshots CI run (or one
# after an intentional UI change) fails and uploads *.actual.png artifacts.
# A human reviews those PNGs and commits the approved versions here as
# tests/smoke/screenshots/<frame>.approved.png.
#
# This .gitkeep keeps the directory tracked until the first baselines land.
